{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c6b9087351b8f26df56379d78214e5ab70d56dc12dbaab033b8adf9f43d96b57", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n撮影が始まる時間だけど、エレナの準備はどうかな？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n现在已经到开拍时间了，艾丽娜准备得怎么样了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "388bba5fab54c45939f3945906a1c7b3a75e05598db5378b410a9463dae99622", "ja": "お待たせ、{$P$}！\nどうかナ？　ちゃんと似合ってる？", "zh": "让你久等了，{$P$}！\n怎么样？很适合我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1002_p", "source_sha256": "df659002a6d5deec5df8a518f05c639e28c7279f23d97235e556529cba3b0fdd", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "啊，当然了。非常适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "111c0ff94a85fb917648247bd6075cf41ab4fceb30fb2e618c938f9c8c2f9ac0", "ja": "よかった♪　かわいいパジャマで撮ってもらえるなんて\nうれしくて、テンションが上がっちゃうヨ！", "zh": "太好了♪　能穿着可爱的睡衣拍摄，\n我好开心，情绪都要嗨起来了哟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1004_p", "source_sha256": "84aa0a062f4cffb7a7a1a581e7a0eeee43eab1ee3b995c2534d92fbefc4dd8d3", "ja": "喜んでくれたみたいでよかった。でも今日は、\n大人な雰囲気を撮りたいから、もう少し落ち着こう。", "zh": "你喜欢就太好了。不过今天\n想拍出成熟的氛围，所以稍微再冷静一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "a3f1fd12ab695badadebd395c2cebdb59a2c5f447f6c719955ac283fd582d46d", "ja": "あっ、そうだった。『大人な夜のひととき』って\nテーマなんだよネ。……ワタシにできるカナ～？", "zh": "啊，对哦。主题是“成熟夜晚的片刻”嘛。\n……我能做到吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "85cb7702bd33c26f278ebaa4bd2cd6d96e27ce0bd9824d4f3adb5b7cdddece4a", "ja": "ワタシ……ママンみたいな大人じゃないヨ？\nいつかは、そうなりたいって思ってるケド……。", "zh": "我……还不是像妈妈那样成熟的大人哦？\n虽然我也想着总有一天能变成那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1007_p", "source_sha256": "745b698debb6252b26a4e8d9947371b02958e3cd029aad96b424dbd6ec277eb5", "ja": "大丈夫。いつもの明るくて元気なエレナの中にも、\n大人っぽさを感じることがあるよ。", "zh": "没关系。在平时开朗又充满活力的艾莲娜身上，\n我也能感受到成熟的一面哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "124e1f7ab47ed641aee38e781d3ae9449c954fd225d4186fcaebf6001d76645f", "ja": "そ、そうなノ？　……あんまり言われたことないから、\nうれしいナ♪　うん……ワタシ、がんばってみる！", "zh": "是、是这样的吗？……因为别人不太这么说，\n所以我很开心♪嗯……我会努力试试看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "0af996c59dcc36665a3d86f6172d52081aa3af922edaafccd74a32efccc21c78", "ja": "えっと……大人なカンジってどうすればいいノ？", "zh": "那个……成熟的感觉要怎么表现才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1010_p", "source_sha256": "83199d82ef5366e4ce1086b195560367246d3568aa189aceb3af277231b02bba", "ja": "そうだな。理想の女性をイメージしてみるのはどうだ？\nエレナがなりたい大人の女性とか。", "zh": "嗯……不如试着想象一下理想女性的样子？\n比如说，艾蕾娜想成为的那种成熟女性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "36d7fb7977bb700ba4f94c7a3d658d648d41dbe4c3814f91cc01d7f4f2377a0f", "ja": "ワタシがなりたい？　……{$P$}、\nちょっと質問があるんだケド、いいカナ？", "zh": "我想成为的？……{$P$}，\n我有个问题想问你，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b6c5b641f2de92fdbb70f45532042ee788fe81be7a36610f20b1728d18a3f71a", "ja": "ああ、なんでも聞いてくれ！", "zh": "啊，尽管问吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "cfab5b04f3639efc9ed03c8763231ad39a1072be73352ce843219a6f32ed1171", "ja": "あのね……{$P$}が好きな女性って、\nどんなタイプなノ？", "zh": "那个……喜欢{$P$}的女性，是什么类型的呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1014_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "6ee2b99ff9a0d3e8c1a87d508dbb27f0073eae4539836ee74dc7d3790341a7ee", "ja": "イメージの参考にするから、教えて？\n今、なんでも聞いていいって言ったよネ？", "zh": "我想拿来参考一下，告诉我嘛？\n你刚才不是说现在什么都可以问吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a4fc492ba91ab66f693723b0acbf98f241741c0f14cbc1479b3438ddb8976189", "ja": "あ、いや……\n聞いてくれっていうのは仕事のことで……。", "zh": "啊，不是……\n我说的“问吧”是指工作上的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0323_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "f57a982501c18dd94120eec4896566fbabf8c43e7114bc08baa4332523ddc7a2", "ja": "これもお仕事に必要なコトだヨ？\nほらほら、撮影が始まっちゃう前に……ね、教えて♪", "zh": "这也是工作上必需的事哦？\n快快，在拍摄开始之前……告诉我嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
